#: src/allow-duplicate-recipes.md:1
msgid "Allow Duplicate Recipes"
msgstr ""

#: src/allow-duplicate-recipes.md:3
msgid ""
"If `allow-duplicate-recipes` is set to `true`, defining multiple recipes "
"with the same name is not an error and the last definition is used. Defaults "
"to `false`."
msgstr ""
